{%- comment -%}
  VAT relief checkbox for a single cart line.

  Usage, inside your cart line loop:

    {% render 'vat-relief-checkbox', line_item: item, line_index: forloop.index %}

  Renders nothing unless the line is one half of a VAT-relief pair, so it is
  safe to call for every line.

  Two states:
    - standard variant (taxed)       -> unticked box, ticking swaps to the
                                        zero-rated variant of the same product
    - relief variant (zero-rated)    -> ticked box, unticking swaps back

  Eligibility is the product metafield custom.vat_relief_eligible. The pairing
  metafields alone would be enough to render the box, but a product that has
  been de-flagged keeps its already-provisioned pair, and the box must stop
  offering relief the moment the flag goes false. Checked explicitly against
  false rather than "not true", so a missing or unreadable metafield leaves an
  already-paired line working instead of silently killing the feature.

  The buyer's declaration is recorded as the visible line property
  "VAT relief declaration"
  (plus a hidden `_vat_relief_declared_at` timestamp) so the order carries
  evidence of the self-declaration, which is the part HMRC cares about. The
  property does NOT drive the tax — the merchandise does.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign variant = line_item.variant
  assign paired = variant.metafields.vat_relief.paired_variant.value
  assign original = variant.metafields.vat_relief.original_variant.value
  assign eligibility = line_item.product.metafields.custom.vat_relief_eligible

  if original
    assign is_relieved = true
    assign swap_target = original.id
  elsif paired
    assign is_relieved = false
    assign swap_target = paired.id
  else
    assign swap_target = blank
  endif

  if eligibility
    if eligibility.value == false or eligibility.value == 'false'
      assign swap_target = blank
    endif
  endif
-%}

{%- if swap_target != blank -%}
  <div class="vat-relief" data-vat-relief>
    <label class="vat-relief__label">
      <input
        type="checkbox"
        class="vat-relief__input"
        data-vat-relief-toggle
        data-line-index="{{ line_index }}"
        data-line-key="{{ line_item.key }}"
        data-swap-to="{{ swap_target }}"
        data-quantity="{{ line_item.quantity }}"
        {% if is_relieved %}checked{% endif %}
      >
      <span class="vat-relief__text">
        <strong>Tick the box to remove VAT.</strong>
      </span>
    </label>
    <span class="vat-relief__status" data-vat-relief-status hidden>Updating…</span>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
